The files in this folder are generated, not drawn: tools/pixelart/make_golden_corpus.lua authors
the .aseprite files through Aseprite's Lua API and tools/pixelart/make_golden_corpus.py exports
their PNG and JSON goldens with Aseprite (Aseprite 1.3.18.6-dev); corpus.json lists every command.
Like those scripts they are MIT licensed, (c) Eduardo Doria and contributors.
Regenerate: JASPER_ASEPRITE=<aseprite> python3 tools/pixelart/make_golden_corpus.py corpus
